n\r\nNavigate to `[path to vcpkg]/ports/[package name]` and edit the file `vcpkg.json`.\r\nInside, you'll see something like:\r\n```\r\n\"dependencies\":  [\r\n  // dependencies,\r\n  \"vulkan\",\r\n // more dependencies...\r\n]\r\n```\r\nSimply remove the `\"vulkan\",` part and attempt to install again.\r\nThis workaround will likely break every time you run a git pull on vcpkg, but it will allow you to complete the installation and use the desired package in your applications.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments/1063282066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Eric-Brown","id":10734565,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzM0NTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10734565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown","html_url":"https://github.com/Eric-Brown","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-Brown/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":7964074135,"node_id":"AE_lADOBBJcqc4pPEmrzwAAAAHasiCX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/7964074135","actor":{"login":"Cheney-W","id":38240633,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjQwNjMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38